forward to in the near future?

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:44.630
TRACY FREY: That's
a great question.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:49.120
So I think what is top of
mind for me is all of the ways

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:53.320
that we can make AI easier
for companies to use,

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:56.170
how we can help them
scale their businesses.

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:59.230
And so we are
spending a lot of time

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:03.820
in really building that ease of
use into everything we offer.

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:06.640
Another area that you will
likely start to see from us

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:10.150
is continuing our efforts
around explainability.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:13.570
So I really firmly
believe that in order

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:17.920
