machine learning models

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:30.140
and how they're
making decisions.

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:32.914
And so we have a lot of exciting
efforts around explainability

00:08:32.914 --> 00:08:33.789
and interpretability.

00:08:33.789 --> 00:08:34.497
RETO MEIER: Yeah.

00:08:34.497 --> 00:08:36.340
I mean, trust is such
an important feature

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:37.840
in all of the things that we do.

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:39.039
TRACY FREY: That's right.

00:08:39.039 --> 00:08:41.039
RETO MEIER: Tracy, thank
you so much for helping

00:08:41.039 --> 00:08:43.010
us understand the power
