00:40:14.580 --> 00:40:17.290
Terry, tell me, what
am I looking at here?

00:40:17.290 --> 00:40:18.910
I was promised pie.

00:40:18.910 --> 00:40:19.920
All I see is pizza.

00:40:19.920 --> 00:40:21.460
What's going on?

00:40:21.460 --> 00:40:23.290
TERRY RYAN: It is a
form of pie, right?

00:40:23.290 --> 00:40:28.120
So we have an app here that
will authenticate pizza

00:40:28.120 --> 00:40:29.870
to a certain region
of the country, right?

00:40:29.870 --> 00:40:31.245
Like, we have New
York pizza, you

00:40:31.245 --> 00:40:33.280
have California
pizza, Chicago pizza.

00:40:33.280 --> 00:40:35.530
This app will
judge how authentic

00:40:35.530 --> 00:40:37.620
it is for what style
