01:19:19.168 --> 01:19:21.168
And then we can move
forward and do other stuff.

01:19:21.168 --> 01:19:22.860
JOANNA SMITH: I love
the scale power.

01:19:22.860 --> 01:19:24.900
Now, you had one more
